==English==

===Etymology===
{{PIE root|en|terkʷ}}
From {{inh|en|enm|extorcion}}, {{m|enm|extorcioun}}, {{m|enm|extorsioun}}, from {{der|en|LL.|extortiō}}, from {{m|la|extorqueō}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ɪkˈstɔːʃn/|lang=en}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ɪkˈstɔːɹʃn/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(r)ʃən|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

# The practice of [[extort]]ing [[money]] or other [[property]] by the use of [[force]] or [[threat]]s.

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|blackmail}}

====Related terms====
* [[extortionary]], [[extortionate]], [[extortive]]

